#. [pages.DeviceList.deviceStatusDescription]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. Represents the status of the testing device by evaluating its activity since the start of yesterday: - Up/Green: there are tests assigned to the device, or the user manually set that the device performed tests (set as Reported Active) - Down/Red: the user manually set that the device is down - Unknown/Yellow: there aren't tests registered for the device and the user didn't set any status - Not Recorded/Grey: something is going wrong with Aspect, because it didn't set any status - needs attention
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid ""
"Represents the status of the testing device by evaluating its activity since "
"the start of yesterday: - Up/Green: there are tests assigned to the device, "
"or the user manually set that the device performed tests (set as Reported "
"Active) - Down/Red: the user manually set that the device is down - Unknown/"
"Yellow: there aren't tests registered for the device and the user didn't set "
"any status - Not Recorded/Grey: something is going wrong with Aspect, "
"because it didn't set any status - needs attention"
msgstr ""
"Représente l'état du dispositif de test en évaluant son activité depuis le "
"début de la journée d'hier : - Up/Green : il y a des tests assignés à "
"l'appareil, ou l'utilisateur a défini manuellement que l'appareil a effectué "
"des tests (défini comme Reported Active) - Down/Red : l'utilisateur a défini "
"manuellement que l'appareil est hors service - Unknown/Yellow : il n'y a pas "
"de tests enregistrés pour l'appareil et l'utilisateur n'a pas défini d'état "
"- Not Recorded/Grey : quelque chose ne va pas avec Aspect, parce qu'il n'a "
"pas défini d'état - nécessite une attention particulière"

#. [pages.DeviceList.connectorStatusDescription]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. Represents the status of the testing device connector, like GeneXpert, by evaluating the connectivity since the start of yesterday: - Online/Green: the connector made at least one connection with Aspect - Offline/Red: the connector didn't make any connections with Aspect - needs attention
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid ""
"Represents the status of the testing device connector, like GeneXpert, by "
"evaluating the connectivity since the start of yesterday: - Online/Green: "
"the connector made at least one connection with Aspect - Offline/Red: the "
"connector didn't make any connections with Aspect - needs attention"
msgstr ""
"Représente l'état du connecteur du dispositif de test, comme GeneXpert, en "
"évaluant la connectivité depuis le début de la journée d'hier : - En ligne/"
"Vert : le connecteur a établi au moins une connexion avec Aspect - Hors "
"ligne/Rouge : le connecteur n'a établi aucune connexion avec Aspect - "
"nécessite une attention particulière"

