#. [pages.OperationalData.percentViaSmsDescription]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. The percentage of reported results that were reported via SMS.
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid "The percentage of reported results that were reported via SMS."
msgstr ""
"Le pourcentage de résultats communiqués qui ont été communiqués par SMS."

#. [pages.InventoryItemsList.projectedWasteDescription]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. The projected stock waste, assuming that the cartridges to be consumed are always the ones closer to their expiration
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid ""
"The projected stock waste, assuming that the cartridges to be consumed are "
"always the ones closer to their expiration"
msgstr ""
"Le gaspillage de stock projeté, en supposant que les cartouches à consommer "
"sont toujours celles qui sont les plus proches de leur expiration"

#. [pages.Notification.type.notificationTypeResultBasedMessage]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. The result based notification can be sent on test creation or on test creation and update. Also, a test is only going to trigger a notification if it is less than {daysLimitToNotifyResults} days old, it was done before the last update of this notification, and if any of the next conditions are accomplished: - All the custom fields referenced in the templates of the notification were filled in the test - {hoursNotificationsShouldWaitForCustomFields} hours passed since the test was done
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid ""
"The result based notification can be sent on test creation or on test "
"creation and update. Also, a test is only going to trigger a notification if "
"it is less than {daysLimitToNotifyResults} days old, it was done before the "
"last update of this notification, and if any of the next conditions are "
"accomplished: - All the custom fields referenced in the templates of the "
"notification were filled in the test - "
"{hoursNotificationsShouldWaitForCustomFields} hours passed since the test "
"was done"
msgstr ""
"La notification basée sur les résultats peut être envoyée lors de la "
"création du test ou lors de la création et de la mise à jour du test. De "
"plus, un test ne déclenchera une notification que s'il date de moins de "
"{daysLimitToNotifyResults} jours, s'il a été effectué avant la dernière mise "
"à jour de cette notification et si l'une des conditions suivantes est "
"remplie : - Tous les champs personnalisés référencés dans les modèles de "
"notification ont été remplis dans le test - "
"{hoursNotificationsShouldWaitForCustomFields} heures se sont écoulées depuis "
"la fin du test"

#. [errorResponseMessages.common.filterError.message]
#. defaultMessage is:
