#. [pages.Notification.type.LowFieldCompletionRateMessage]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. This notification will be triggered any time a site changes its custom fields completion rate to less than 0.8. Also, it will be sent only if you have the custom field completion weight set in your country. Please check with your administrator before using it.
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid ""
"This notification will be triggered any time a site changes its custom "
"fields completion rate to less than 0.8. Also, it will be sent only if you "
"have the custom field completion weight set in your country. Please check "
"with your administrator before using it."
msgstr ""
"Cette notification sera déclenchée chaque fois qu'un site verra son taux de "
"remplissage des champs personnalisés passer à moins de 0,8. En outre, elle "
"ne sera envoyée que si vous avez défini le poids de remplissage des champs "
"personnalisés dans votre pays. Veuillez vérifier auprès de votre "
"administrateur avant de l'utiliser."

